  - m_Id: 6278461214720
    m_Localized: 'Active: select a combatant; it falls asleep and loses its next
      turn.


      Passive: every time Fasila uses a skill, one of her Fragments
      resonates. With 3 resonating Fragments, her next skill doubles its effects
      (stats, duration, etc.).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6322916642816
    m_Localized: "Reduces the magic defense of the target combatant by X% for 2 rounds.\n\nX%
      = 10% \xD7 (Fasila's Health / 50)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6371717369856
    m_Localized: Freezes the enemy combatants in the center and right positions for
      2 rounds (they lose their next 2 turns).
